---
title: Matcha white chocolate ganache
source: https://bitesbybianca.com/matcha-ganache/
cuisine: Japanese
---

Add @white chocolate{170 g} and @heavy cream{60 g} to a #bowl and heat in the microwave for ~{45 seconds} until melted and smooth.

Add @matcha powder{6 g} to the melted white chocolate and stir until smooth.
